pb-4\n          md:px-8 md:pb-6\n        \"><h4 class=\"text-body-l font-extrabold text-soft-black\">Instructions</h4><div class=\"prose text-body-s\"><p><strong>NOTE</strong>: Do your recaps out loud in the beginning to keep yourself honest about the quality and completeness of the recaps. Transition to silent recaps when you feel like you're ready.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Read, translate, and quip paragraph 1<span class=\"cursor-pointer \n                      cursor-help underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2\n                    \" data-state=\"closed\">*</span>. Do it just like LR.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>This means all the details are included just like they would be on LR.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Quip after <em>every</em> Translation.&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>This standard applies to every paragraph you ever translate on RC.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Look away from paragraph 1 and recap the <strong>FULL TRANSLATION</strong> of paragraph 1 silently.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>The recap is not a summary, gist, or main point.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The recap should not omit names, dates, and lists.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The recap should not be a shopping list of information. It should be a story in your own words.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>It is encouraged to mix up the order of the sentences and ideas.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>This standard applies to every paragraph (or collection of paragraphs) you ever recap on RC.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Read, translate, and quip paragraph 2. Do it just like LR.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Look away from paragraph 2 and recap the <strong>FULL TRANSLATION</strong> of paragraph 2 silently.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Without looking back, recap the Translations of paragraphs 1 + 2 back to back silently.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Read, translate, and quip paragraph 3. Do it just like LR.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Look away from paragraph 3 and recap the <strong>FULL TRANSLATION</strong> of paragraph 3 silently.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Without looking back, recap the Translations of paragraphs 1 + 2 + 3 back to back silently.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Repeat this pattern for all remaining paragraphs.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Complete this same process on all remaining passages in the section.</p>\n</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"pt-2\"><a href=\"/workouts-and-routines/workouts/decaf-rc-translation-drill\"><button class=\"\n    inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-full\n    font-extrabold uppercase lh-outline\n    [transition:background-color_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1),border-color_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1),box-shadow_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1),translate_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1)]\n    disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50\n   \n          border-black text-black\n          hover:not-disabled:-translate-x-[3px]\n          hover:not-disabled:-translate-y-[3px]\n          hover:not-disabled:shadow-[3px_3px_0_0_#171712]\n          active:not-disabled:-translate-x-[1px]\n          active:not-disabled:-translate-y-[1px]\n          active:not-disabled:shadow-[1px_1px_0_0_#171712]\n         h-[38px] gap-2 text-caption-medium border-[2px] pl-4 pr-3\">See full workout details<span class=\"flex items-center justify-center\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"12\" class=\"\" viewBox=\"0 0 26 19\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-testid=\"arrow-icon\"><path d=\"M20.25 10.9383H1.66667C1.19444 10.9383 0.798611 10.7786 0.479167 10.4592C0.159722 10.1397 0 9.74389 0 9.27167C0 8.79945 0.159722 8.40361 0.479167 8.08417C0.798611 7.76472 1.19444 7.605 1.66667 7.605H20.25L15.5 2.855C15.1667 2.52167 15.0069 2.13278 15.0208 1.68833C15.0347 1.24389 15.1944 0.855 15.5 0.521667C15.8333 0.188333 16.2292 0.0147222 16.6875 0.000833333C17.1458 -0.0130556 17.5417 0.146667 17.875 0.48L25.5 8.105C25.6667 8.27167 25.7847 8.45222 25.8542 8.64667C25.9236 8.84111 25.9583 9.04945 25.9583 9.27167C25.9583 9.49389 25.9236 9.70222 25.8542 9.89667C25.7847 10.0911 25.6667 10.2717 25.5 10.4383L17.875