    "name": "Vocab Training",
    "text": "4\nVocab Training\nInstructions\n\nHighlight any word you wouldn't bet your LSAT score on during all LSAT sections and during all Extracurricular Reading.\n\nThese highlighted words are your vocab words.\n\nHarvest all the vocab words you've highlighted after your section or reading is complete.\n\nHarvesting your words means writing down each of your vocab words in a tracker. You can use my template or create a simple Google Sheet for this.\n\nAlways harvest your vocab words the same day that you highlight them.\n\nTo further optimize your vocab harvesting, watch the How to Harvest Vocab Words video.\n\nPractice your vocab words daily for at least 10 minutes.\n\nTo practice, follow the procedures outlined in the How to Learn Vocab Without AI video or the How to Learn Vocab: AI Supercharged Edition video.\n\n10 minutes of practice is a minimum, not a maximum. If you have a 100+ number of vocab words to learn, do not be afraid to practice for a longer period of time.\n\nSEE FULL WORKOUT DETAILS",
